---
/** The one icon: an outbound arrow, 1.5 stroke, sized to the text. */
---

<svg
  class="arrow"
  width="0.75em"
  height="0.75em"
  viewBox="0 0 12 12"
  fill="none"
  stroke="currentColor"
  stroke-width="1.5"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path d="M3 9 9 3M4.5 3H9v4.5"></path>
</svg>

<style>
  .arrow {
    display: inline-block;
    vertical-align: -0.05em;
    margin-left: 0.2em;
  }
</style>
